k="false">https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/1</guid><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 08:11:00 -0400</pubDate></item><item><title>The Far Side - 2026-09-30 #1</title><link>https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/0</link><description>&lt;div style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://comiccaster.xyz/.netlify/functions/proxy-farside-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffeatureassets.amuniversal.com%2Fassets%2F40760810e6f80137ce50005056a9545d" alt="The Far Side comic" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 10px; font-style: italic;"&gt;“Oh, yeah? Lewis, you’re fired! You apparently forgot this is a cartoon, and I can read every word you think!”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 0.9em;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.thefarside.com/"&gt;Visit The Far Side&lt;/a&gt; | © Gary Larson&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/0</guid><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 08:10:00 -0400</pubDate></item><item><title>The Far Side - 2026-09-29 #5</title><link>https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/29/4</link><description>&lt;div style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://comiccaster.xyz/.netlify/functions/proxy-farside-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffeatureassets.amuniversal.com%2Fassets%2F04585120cdd30137c56b005056a9545d" alt="The Far Side comic" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 10px; font-style: italic;"&gt;“And the last gladiator left alive will win the contest. But first … the egg-toss!”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 0.9em;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.thefarside.com/"&gt;Visit The Far Side&lt;/a&gt; | © Gary Larson&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/29/4</guid><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 08:09:00 -0400</pubDate></item><item><title>The Far Side - 2026-09-29 #4</title><link>https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/29/3</link><de