/4</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:04:00 -0400</pubDate></item><item><title>The Far Side - 2026-09-28 #4</title><link>https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/28/3</link><description>&lt;div style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://comiccaster.xyz/.netlify/functions/proxy-farside-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffeatureassets.amuniversal.com%2Fassets%2F2fda5ab0ea260137cfba005056a9545d" alt="The Far Side comic" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 10px; font-style: italic;"&gt;Professor Wainwright’s painstaking field research to decode the language of bears comes to a sudden and horrific end.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 0.9em;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.thefarside.com/"&gt;Visit The Far Side&lt;/a&gt; | © Gary Larson&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/28/3</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:03:00 -0400</pubDate></item><item><title>The Far Side - 2026-09-28 #3</title><link>https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/28/2</link><description>&lt;div style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://comiccaster.xyz/.netlify/functions/proxy-farside-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffeatureassets.amuniversal.com%2Fassets%2F19333460cdd40137c56b005056a9545d" alt="The Far Side comic" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 10px; font-style: italic;"&gt;“Oh, Mrs. Oswald ... you’ve forgotten something again.”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 0.9em;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.thefarside.com/"&gt;Visit The Far Side&lt;/a&gt; | © Gary Larson&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/28/2</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:02:00 -0400</pubDate></item><item><title>The Far Side - 2026-09-28 #2</title><link>https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/28/1</link><description>&lt;div style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margi